    │ LINE │                                                              
    └──────┘                                                              
                                                                          
  Too wide, shows as code:                                                
                                                                          
    graph LR                                                              
      Alpha --> Bravo --> Charlie --> Delta --> Echo --> Foxtrot --> Golf 
  --> Hotel                                                               
                                                                          
  A parse error, shows as code:                                           
                                                                          
    sequenceDiagram                                                       
      A->>                                                                
                                                                          
  Not a type it draws, shows as code:                                     
                                                                          
    pie title Pets                                                        
      "Dogs" : 3                                                          
      "Cats" : 2                                                          
                                                                          
  In a list it stays code:                                                
                                                                          
  • Item                                                                  
    graph LR                                                              
      A --> B                                                             
                                                                          
                                                                          
  The end.                                                                

